    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "yookoso, you are right. 禁じる means 抑える or \" to suppress\", while 得ない means cannot or できない。禁じ得ない literally means 禁じることができない／抑えることができない or \"unable to supress\", but this grammar always used together with feelings such as 同情、驚き、失望、涙,....",
      "html": "yookoso, you are right. 禁じる means 抑える or \" to suppress\", while 得ない means cannot or できない。禁じ得ない literally means 禁じることができない／抑えることができない or \"unable to supress\", but this grammar always used together with feelings such as 同情、驚き、失望、涙,....",
      "credits_raw": "誠",
      "content_sha256": "b6d5a5fae5b1dbd9d8780cebc1ca838d47fd588a75ce833a1ada043dce559075",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Is this just the verb 禁じる + 得る [eru]? If so, should it have it's own entry when [eru] already exists?",
      "html": "Is this just the verb 禁じる + 得る [eru]? If so, should it have it's own entry when [eru] already exists?",
      "credits_raw": "yookoso",
      "content_sha256": "694a49baee916f968208a3c6d0dd12a2a3d7830cdcbf2a1a6af7718128c31a83",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I think the nuance is more towards \"(I) can't control/supress\".\nIt is often used with 怒り,同情,驚き,失望,涙,笑い",
      "html": "I think the nuance is more towards \"(I) can't control/supress\".<br/>It is often used with 怒り,同情,驚き,失望,涙,笑い",
      "credits_raw": "blabby",
      "content_sha256": "c0de1ad70b4d2ffed4ba2c2259c1dfcb75ea60eaa475be8bac2ceb727195eb7e",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "is this the same as [tenaranai]",
      "html": "is this the same as [tenaranai]",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "7f1cece88bdd8a3e24e8248687e5fdc9c09bb4cf30ea579dd54a397c8fdc0f9d",
